    "rating": 3.3,
    "reference": "ChIJE-p5kfg7yUwRs5LxPYGC2lY",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Jasmine Moore",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115471596544976472672/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUBdEFFvWfa48pzYdYyhjHiZQcJTFOHItO3QuEkCvtqC0M9C54=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "The burgers were really good. The drinks fit well in one hand, so both my instructor and myself could drink while driving. The fries were a little salty but hey, who couldn't use a little extra cholesterol? I highly recommend this place for anyone who loves Nascar and Grease (the movie). Perfect 5/7.",
        "time": 1492702160,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julie Gilmore",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101386328765026608068/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKEtUKWE3uU74J217AODtUmcOxI0GScGmPsuZOI2qGYEI1CONw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I am definitely happy I chose Wendy’s to learn how to drive! The website is very clear and organized and it was easy to book my in-car sessions. The secretary was really nice and explained everything clearly so I would understand. She was always there to answer my questions. Since I took my lessons during the pandemic, we did the theory sessions online and it was nice to have to just answer questions based on a PowerPoint they sent by email. The instructors were also very nice and I felt prepared when it came time for my road test at the saaq! Despite it being the middle of the pandemic, I was able to finish my courses in the designated 13 months!",
        "time": 1682805453,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lexie Grey",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114168580313937776250/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIBS2jdOKOwMcx1lx3EjMDh-gRGiqsJvdFfFshLbpHkbARC4w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I recently finished the course here and I am not impressed. Whoever answers the emails does not bother being polite. They are also unorganized.. when the theory classes were no longer happening in person as a result of the pandemic, we were not notified and showed up for our class only to find out they were closed. An email or call to notify us would have been appreciated. I often wanted to email the school to ask questions (as their website is unclear and does not offer much information) but I didn’t because I knew I would be judged and would receive a rude response.\nAlthough I’m unsatisfied with the school and administrative staff, I liked my instructors, and liked that we could book in-cars online. I was also prepared for my road test.",
        "time": 1618104857,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jayda Christean",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115632285302833470575/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJaHUht_IpQOfQ2j9wOEmB2uI4PqYRw3BjRYAKthGaEvooLhg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Wish I could rate  it 0 stars. Absolutely a terrible driving school, a week before my SAAQ driving exam my in car driving instructor told me I was going to fail, and told me to wear something nice so I'd have a better chance at getting my license..? I ended up passing my SAAQ driving exam with the person who was evaluating me said I almost scored 100, but made one tiny mistake. If you want your teenager to be a confident driver, and not have someone tell them they're terrible every lesson, make sure you go to another driving school. Also as a 20 year old female, in all of the time I've been around disgusting men who have made me feel like I need to appease them with my appearance, never have I felt so degraded than I did when my male driving instructor said that I should wear something nice to have a better chance at getting my license.",
        "time": 1553808757,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jane Wilkins",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105523335624192308957/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKgssISiHiksisTdJuQGIcJXfCD-uks8Uox22GtBL2v3e35Cg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "They were negligent and made a HUGE mistake in the attestation paperwork. When we got to the SAAQ for the final test, we were turned away and were refused for testing due to errors on the attestation.\nWhen I got on the phone immediately with the secretary, she wanted me to fill in the missing paperwork and pretend nothing had happened.\nWhen I went straight to the office in Kirkland to have her fix their mistake, she had the audacity to suggest that WE should have known the paperwork was incomplete. At the suggestion of compensation for their negligence, my child's broken heart and shatteted confidence, and my loss of wages for now TWO days, the secretary looked positively dumbfounded that I should even ask.  Honestly, a teenaged secretary should not have to deal with irate customers like myself. I asked for Wendy's number so I can speak to her myself and was refused. Any guesses as to whether or not Wendy will have the business sense to call me back?\nIt has now been about 52 hours since I asked to have Wendy call me and I am STILL waiting. No surprise there!",
        "time": 1511659048,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
    "types": [
      "establishment",
